# Power BI Dashboard

This folder contains the Power BI report developed for the Renewable Energy Performance Analysis project.

## Dashboard Pages

### 1. Renewable Energy Performance Overview
- Total energy generation and export
- Total billing and outstanding collections
- Monthly generation versus export
- Plant-level performance overview

### 2. Plant Performance & Loss Analysis
- Energy generation and export by plant
- Capacity Utilization Factor (CUF)
- Transmission loss analysis
- RKVAH loss analysis

### 3. Billing & Receivables Analysis
- Total invoice amount
- Total receivables and collections
- Outstanding collection amount
- Invoice status distribution
- Monthly receivables versus collections

## Key Features
- Interactive report pages
- KPI cards and charts
- Filters and slicers for data exploration
- Business-focused operational and financial insights

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Data modelling

## Project File

`Renewable_Energy_Analytics.pbix`

## Data Quality Note

The source data contains negative transmission-loss values and export-efficiency values above 100% for certain plants. These require further validation before drawing operational conclusions.
